 ],
 "synopsis": "Anupam Rasayan India Limited, through its wholly owned subsidiary Mates Visa Consultancy Private Limited, acquired a controlling stake of 47.95% in Bliss GVS Pharma Limited by purchasing 5,09,86,264 equity shares. The transaction was executed via a share purchase agreement and a subsequent mandatory open offer involving the promoters of Bliss GVS Pharma and certain other shareholders as sellers. Law firm Kanga & Co acted as the legal adviser to the sellers on the transaction, assisting with transaction documentation, the open offer process, and regulatory compliance.",
